EF AI Workspace: chat page fixes from the live QA on Railway dev (2026-10-26, desktop and mobile, the three models).

- A search call written as text (QA-02, P0). Qwen with built-in search sometimes writes it as text
  («<tool_call>\n<web_search>\n{"query": …}…</tool_call>») and stops; live, a whole reply was that text.
  - utils/efaiwFollowUps.ts: stripWrittenToolCalls drops such a call at the start of a line and outside a code fence,
    also one still open at the end. visibleReplyText leaves it and the suggestions block out; display, copy, read aloud
    and download use it.
- A reply with nothing to show. Measured on Qwen directly: about one news question in eight came back with only the
  suggestions block; live also only «أبحث عن …» and nothing after it.
  - EfReplyExtras.tsx: isEmptyReply covers no visible text, or only a short «أبحث/سأبحث/Let me search…» line, with no
    tool or other output. Thinking alone is not an answer, and a reply the employee stopped (`unfinished`) is not empty.
  - EfEmptyReply shows «لم يصل رد هذه المرة.» with «أعد المحاولة» on the latest reply. A fresh empty latest reply (streamed in
    this page, so without `createdAt` yet, or under 90 s old; not an old chat being opened) is retried once by itself,
    once per question in the page.
  - The suggestions are hidden under an empty reply. The notice sits in the reply's footer in ContentRender.tsx and
    MessageRender.tsx.
- Letters as artifacts (QA-03). utils/efaiwDocx.ts textArtifactsOf: the text or Markdown artifacts of a reply,
  unwrapped.
  - isDocumentReply reads it, so a letter carried as an artifact gets its Word/PDF bar again.
  - The reply's downloads (DownloadReply.replyMarkdown) give that document alone, without the lines around it.
- PowerPoint closing slide (QA-06):
  - isClosingTitle accepts one closing title or several joined («الخلاصة والخطوات التالية», «Summary and next steps»),
    also التوصيات / recommendations.
  - The chat's «الافتراضات» line no longer becomes a slide (the document-alone download above).
- «<br>» in table cells (QA-08). utils/efaiwBreaks.ts turns a lone <br> tag into a line break in the reply view (a
  remark plugin in markdownConfig.ts) and in Word, PowerPoint, Excel and the PDF view. Any other HTML stays text.
- Suggestion actions (QA-09):
  - replyLanguage counts most letters outside code and artifact bodies, falling back to the artifact's text without
    tags, so actions under an HTML artifact are sent in Arabic.
  - No «جدول» under a table, no «خطاب رسمي» under a letter.
- MCP for employees (QA-07). hooks/MCP/useMCPIconMap.ts asks for the MCP server list only for a role with MCP USE
  (ADR-0021); employees got a 403 on chat pages.
- Screen reader (found by the browser test of this patch): hooks/SSE/useEventHandlers.ts announced the finished reply's
  whole text, the hidden suggestions block included (since 0038). It now announces the visible text, and nothing for an
  empty reply, whose notice is a status.
- en translation: com_efaiw_empty_reply, com_efaiw_empty_retry.
- Tests: efaiwFollowUps.spec.ts, EfReplyExtras.spec.tsx, efaiwReplyDocuments.test.ts, useMCPIconMap.spec.tsx.

